  "description": "Welcome to Our Guild!\n\nWe’re a friendly and relaxed community that values both fun and commitment. Our goal is to create a space where everyone feels welcome, supported, and motivated to contribute their best—without pressure or stress. Here’s how we keep our guild thriving together:\n\nStay Active, Stay Connected: \nWe ask all members to log in and participate at least once a week. This helps us maintain a lively, engaged group where everyone feels involved and valued. Whether it’s joining events, quests, or simply checking in, your presence matters.\n\nEqual Effort, Shared Success: \nOur guild thrives on teamwork and fairness. Everyone is encouraged to contribute equally to guild activities, whether big or small. By sharing the effort, we build a stronger community and enjoy greater achievements together.\n\nOpen Communication is Key: \nWe understand that life can get busy or unpredictable. If you ever need to take a break or can’t participate in an event, please send us a quick message. Keeping everyone informed helps us plan better and shows respect for your fellow guildmates.\n\nBalance and Enjoyment: \nWe want this guild to be a place where you can relax, have fun, and enjoy the game at your own pace. No pressure, just a supportive group of players who care about each other and the guild’s success.\n\nBy joining us, you become part of a team that values friendship, fairness, and fun. Together, we’ll explore, conquer, and enjoy every adventure that comes our way!\n\nEST. 1/30/26\nLocated in Floating Gardens of Aetheria",
